  "contentHtml": "<DIV>\r\n<DIV style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 10px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(254,222,199); PADDING-LEFT: 10px; PADDING-RIGHT: 10px; BORDER-TOP: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(254,137,67) 3px double; PADDING-TOP: 10px\" class=txc-textbox>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><B><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.6; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">'말머리'에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요^^</SPAN><BR></B></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><B><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.</SPAN></B></SPAN></P></DIV>\r\n<P><BR><!--StartFragment--></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>게임활동 방법입니다.</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">1. 현미경 사용법을 익힙니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">2. 영구프레파라트를 나눠주고 정확한 초점 맞추는 것도 배웁니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">3. 모둠원들끼리 충분히 연습을 한 후에 </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">&nbsp; 현미경을 다양하게 조작해 놓습니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\" ></SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >&nbsp;&nbsp; (</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">예 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">조리개 돌려놓기</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">조동나사 돌리기</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">전원코드 뽑기 등</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >)</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">4. 각 모둠의 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >( )</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">번 학생을 선수로 선발합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">5. 해당 학생은 옆모둠으로 이동합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >6. ‘</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">시작</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >’</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">하면 초점을 맞추고 상을 정확히 찾으면 손을 듭니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">7. 상을 먼저 찾은 학생 모둠을 시상합니다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. ^^</SPAN></P></DIV>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
